{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2020-12-02 14:00:00', 'title': 'TO HELP FLEET CUSTOMERS MAKE THE SWITCH TO ELECTRIC VEHICLES, PG&E INTRODUCES EV FLEET SAVINGS CALCULATOR', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) ANNOUNCED A NEW ONLINE TOOL FOR COMPANIES AND ORGANIZATIONS CONSIDERING TRANSITIONING THEIR FLEETS TO ELECTRIC VEHICLES (EVS). PG&E'S NEW EV FLEET SAVINGS CALCULATOR ALLOWS BUSINESS CUSTOMERS AND PUBLIC AGENCIES WITH MEDIUM- TO HEAVY-DUTY FLEET VEHICLES TO EXPLORE EV INVESTMENT ESTIMATES BASED ON THEIR OWN FLEET SIZES, INFRASTRUCTURE, BUDGET AND OTHER FACTORS. TRANSPORTATION IS THE SINGLE LARGEST SOURCE OF CL"}